.TH dalgona-rules 1  "dalgona-rules " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-rules \- Inspect or test stream rules.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona rules\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or test stream rules.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-rules\-test(1)
Simulate a rule against one input.
.TP
dalgona\-rules\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
